@base = http://localhost:5104
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get Alice's account (5,000 €)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### Withdraw 100 €
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Transfer of 1,500 €: accepted
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 1500 }

### Second transfer of 1,000 € on the same day: refused (daily limit of 2,000 €)
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 1000 }
